Subject: [PATCH 25/48] Finder: macOS-style tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Equal-width tabs across a faint rounded strip, centered titles without
icons, a gray pill for the current tab, a close × on the left of the
hovered tab, and + at the end for a new tab. Recents' tab is named
"Recents", and the sidebar, title and column view follow tab switches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
